            "title": "Healthguard",
            "body": "Customers that work with protected health information can sign a placeholder business associate agreement with us. Eligible plans include additional logging, encryption key options and support processes designed for healthcare workloads. Because Lattice runs transformations inside your own warehouse, the regulated rows themselves stay under your controls, while we protect the code, logs and metadata that describe them and the people who maintain them. [Talk to our healthcare team](/contact) to learn which plans qualify."
          }
